{"id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal.md","title":"序数与序数类","display":"df-ordinal — 序数与序数类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal","aliases":["18-df-ordinal","18-df-013"],"display":"df-ordinal — 序数与序数类","depends_on":["[[18-df-transitive-set]]","[[18-df-set]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.2, (3.2), 3.2.6","source_printed_pages":"20,22–23","source_pdf_pages":"30,32–33","source_correspondence":"expanded-ordinal-definition","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited record; not a new source check","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal</span><span>18-df-013</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal — 序数与序数类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b63d92760bb408d3\" href=\"?note=b63d92760bb408d3\" title=\"18-df-transitive-set\">18-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2, (3.2), 3.2.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"20,22–23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"30,32–33"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"expanded-ordinal-definition"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited record; not a new source check"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 为下式引入的一元序数谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 为集合变量，集合语境见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea75cdbec811405b\" href=\"?note=ea75cdbec811405b\" title=\"18-df-set\">18-df-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63d92760bb408d3\" href=\"?note=b63d92760bb408d3\" title=\"18-df-transitive-set\">18-df-transitive-set</a>。</li>\n<li>类记号是集合论的保守元语言缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{On}\">\\(\\operatorname{On}\\)</span> 表示可定义真类，不是集合变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,\\omega\">\\(0,1,2,\\omega\\)</span> 由下式引入；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>-良序条件允许空载体。固定由无穷公理给出的归纳集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in I_0\">\\(\\varnothing\\in I_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in I_0\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I_0)\">\\(\\forall x\\in I_0\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I_0)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 在下式定义。可数包括有限及空集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^A\">\\(\\omega^A\\)</span> 表示从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的集合函数集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 的最小值在 ZFC 中由 Hartogs 定理保证存在，未增添额外不可数性公理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(a)\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;(x\\notin x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in a\\;((x\\in y\\land y\\in z)\\to x\\in z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq a\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists y\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\notin y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ord}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{On}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in I_0:\\forall I\\;[(0\\in I\\land\\forall y\\in I\\;(y\\cup\\{y\\}\\in I))\\to x\\in I]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\\mathrm{Trans}(a)\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;(x\\notin x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in a\\;((x\\in y\\land y\\in z)\\to x\\in z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq a\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists y\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\notin y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ord}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{On}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in I_0:\\forall I\\;[(0\\in I\\land\\forall y\\in I\\;(y\\cup\\{y\\}\\in I))\\to x\\in I]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Countable}(A)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\omega^A\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\omega_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha\\in\\omega_1&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Countable}(A)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\omega^A\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\omega_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha\\in\\omega_1&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 (3.2)，展开严格良序，避免原稿误用别册非严格 WellOrder 的参数次序。允许空序数0；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的交式可在任一给定归纳集内作分离。原书印刷p22–23给出0、后继及最小极限序数ω，与最小归纳集的冯诺伊曼表示一致。Ord/On 始终为可定义类缩写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"b63d92760bb408d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"ea75cdbec811405b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 为下式引入的一元序数谓词；$a$ 为集合变量，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]；$\\mathrm{Trans}$ 见 [[18-df-transitive-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"b63d92760bb408d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 为下式引入的一元序数谓词；$a$ 为集合变量，集合语境见 [[18-df-set]]；$\\mathrm{Trans}$ 见 [[18-df-transitive-set]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{On}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2,\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\in I_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in I_0\\;(x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in I_0)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\longleftrightarrow\\;&\\mathrm{Trans}(a)\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;(x\\notin x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in a\\;((x\\in y\\land y\\in z)\\to x\\in z)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\subseteq a\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists y\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;x\\notin y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ord}&\\coloneqq\\{a:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{On}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad1\\coloneqq\\{0\\},\\quad2\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\omega&\\coloneqq\\{x\\in I_0:\\forall I\\;[(0\\in I\\land\\forall y\\in I\\;(y\\cup\\{y\\}\\in I))\\to x\\in I]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbb N&\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Countable}(A)&\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\omega^A\\;\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\omega_1&\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\neg\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\omega_1&\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha\\in\\omega_1&\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Countable}(\\alpha)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3091,"backlinks":[{"id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\mathrm{Trans}(A)$、$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ 及序数类 $\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[./18-df-transitive-set]]、[[./18-df-ordinal]]。$L_\\alpha$ 为 [[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]] 的构造层级，仅在序数 $\\alpha$ 上使用。"},{"id":"3cb367216d9bd61d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb8e0157911ac3fc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e5ab7fce1b232e4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"635d9c2a8b21701e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"元理论为 ZFC；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。$\\mathcal L_\\in$ 仅取 [[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]] 中的纯集合论签名，不把该节点的理论公理加入构造。其变量集为 $W$，关系符号为 $\\in_*$；$\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in$ 为该签名公式集。"},{"id":"f61399ef66a953f9","anchor":"ref-