、值为序数的集合函数；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的元语言类缩写。"},{"id":"b8684802726abc97","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]，序数比较取 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。"},{"id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N=\\omega$、$0$ 与所用有限序数取 [[18-df-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集，$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$（[[18-df-ordinal]]）。树的 $N_{\\mathcal T},\\prec_{\\mathcal T},r_{\\mathcal T},\\ell_{\\mathcal T}$ 均由被量化的五元组决定；$h$ 是集合函数。"},{"id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，比较见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]；序数类与 $0,\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega$ 与数值标签所用的自然数域取 [[18-df-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"3792e1826de54ef4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$（[[18-df-ordinal]]），$A\\subseteq\\alpha$ 是集合谓词的外延。$\\mathrm{TI}(\\alpha,A)$ 在元语言中取真值，不是尚未编码的对象算术句。"},{"id":"b2ce8b00b90479d8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N=\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]，$\\omega^\\beta$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。下列递归定义可定义类图 $\\varphi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}^3$，$\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)$ 表示其唯一值；下标与参数均为序数。"},{"id":"42776dd9b2915027","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是给定集合或可定义类，$e$ 是可定义部分类函数；$\\mathrm{Ord},<$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。类图的 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}$ 是元语言缩写，真类不作为 ZFC 集合变量。$A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为集合，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in$ 明确表示集合序同构。$\\operatorname{otp}$ 是该唯一序数的可定义类函数，$\\mathrm{Enum}(X)$ 是下式的类图。"},{"id":"31288cfe398953a3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。"},{"id":"1c1dcb6d897f9b41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"50076d54977c5fd6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a7ec48377bb048a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal]]"}],"outgoing":["b63d92760bb408d3","ea75cdbec811405b"]}